Suddenly, you heard a roar and a wolf with bared teeth appeared in front of you. It was a large beast, definitely larger that you. You prepared to fight, but the monster did not attack. He loudly drew some air in his nose and spoke to you:
"Who are you? Where did you come from?"
"The owner of this house made me look like this. I came to settle accounts with him," you honestly answered.
"Did you try on that wolf skin too?" asked the beast much softer.
"Yes."
"He transformed me the same way. Now I'm something like a watchdog to him," sadly said the werewolf. "I can never become a human again. Do you have a chance?"
"I don't know, but I hope so."